*Certain texts in progress are contained in ((Robin Lee Powell))'s CVS repository, available online on [http://www.digitalkingdom.org/cvsweb/|CVSWeb]. These include:
**A project on translating the [http://www.digitalkingdom.org/cvsweb/lojban/translations/drbible/|Bible]
*A group translation of [http://www.lojban.org/twiki|Alice in Wonderland] hosted on a TWiki
*[http://www.lojban.org/files/roadmap.html#texts|Some texts] (most of them fairly old and shortish) can be found at the [http://www.lojban.org/|Lojban.org] site.
*Several squibs right on this wiki
**A brief description of Tolkien's ((tenguar|F롮oro Tengwar)) in lojban -- Elrond
